---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base title="RoboWiki · Robot hardware selection" description="Official specs and real user experience for robot parts.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4 py-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink">RoboWiki</h1>
    <p class="text-base leading-7 text-ink-2">
      A knowledge base for choosing robot parts: official specs on one side, user ratings and field reports
      collected as GitHub Issues on the other. Joint motors first, then controllers, ESCs, depth cameras, LiDAR and chips.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-semibold text-brand">
      <a href="/catalog.html">Parts library →</a>
      <a href="/suppliers.html">Suppliers →</a>
      <a href="/contributors.html">Contributors →</a>
      <a href="/learn/index.html">Guides →</a>
    </div>
    <p class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-white p-4 text-sm leading-7 text-ink-2">
      The catalog is currently Chinese-first. Part IDs, specs and source metadata are language-neutral;
      ratings and field reports are submitted through GitHub Issues in the data repository.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
